---
import Group from "@/assets/home/group.webp";
---

<section>
	<div class="container">
		<p>在這裡你可以</p>
		<ul>
			<li class="first">學習基礎軟體工程</li>
			<li class="first">專案管理技巧</li>
			<li>伺服器管理與架設網站能力</li>
			<li>擁有自己的課外專案經驗</li>
			<li>學到資工系不會教的實用技能</li>
			<li>修課 & 實習經驗交流分享</li>
			<li>認識一群很棒的人</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</section>
<style define:vars={{ "image-url": `url(${Group.src})` }}>
	section {
		background-image: linear-gradient(#fff, #ffffffa2 30%, #ffffffa2 70%, #fff), var(--image-url);
		background-position: center;
		background-size: cover;
		background-repeat: no-repeat, no-repeat;
		background-size: cover;
		border-radius: 16px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 5rem 2rem;
	}

	.container {
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: auto;
	}

	p {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		font-size: 1.4rem;
	}

	ul {
		list-style: none;
	}

	li {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: rgba(67, 76, 94, 1);
		padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
		background-color: var(--nord6);
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		width: fit-content;
	}

	li.first {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-right: 0.75rem;
	}
</style>
